# What setting a host up from here may leave beside these files: never committed. h9web's keys
# (secrets.json, data.key, any *.key), its backups (*.h9backup) and the backup passphrase, the
# list's secrets (serverlist.cfg), and the Windows host's downloads and logs.
secrets.json
data.key
*.key
*.h9backup
*.h9backup.partial
backup-passphrase*
serverlist.cfg
*.log
windows/downloads/
